      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "FRAMEWORK",
      "narration_text": "The plan is careful about scope. Two point oh keeps everything that works today: accounts, books, tutoring, concept maps, analytics. Then it adds browser-based authoring and review, plus the new one point five learning features. Quantum goes first as the pilot, and the live cancer book isn't touched while that happens.",
